@startuml
!include ../../../images/common-sequence.iuml

title Controller-to-Controller Provisioning — SoftAP Flow

actor User

box "Target Controller (ESP32)" $OnPrem
    participant "Target\nFirmware" as Target
end box

box "Source Controller (ESP32)" $OnPrem
    participant "SoftAP\n(SSID: FireFly-Provisioning)" as AP
    participant "HTTP API" as API
end box

User -> API++ : **Enable Provisioning Mode**\nPUT /api/provisioning\n""{visual-token}""

break visual-token Invalid
    API --> User : HTTP 401
end

API --> User : HTTP 202
API -> AP-- : **Start SoftAP**\nWPA2 password = ""nibble-interleave(BSSID)""\nTX power = ""2 dBm""\nmax clients = ""1""


Target -> Target : **Boot — check for own config file**\nLittleFS: ""/controllers/{uuid}""
Target -> Target : **Config missing — scan for SSID**\n"""FireFly-Provisioning""" (exact)
Target -> Target : **Read BSSID from scan result**\ncompute password = ""nibble-interleave(BSSID)""
Target -> Target : **Override WiFi station MAC**\nwith own Ethernet MAC address
Target -> AP++ : **Connect using WPA2**\nwith computed password (10 s timeout)

break MAC not in allowlist
    AP -> API : **Rogue client event**
    API -> API : **Shut down SoftAP**
    AP --> Target-- : Disconnect
    Target -> Target : **Continue unprovisioned**
end

AP --> Target-- : Connected (DHCP 192.168.4.x)

Target -> API++ : **Token Exchange**\nPOST /api/provisioning/token\n""{ "uuid": "...", "mac": "aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:ff" }""

break Request is not from SoftAP
    API --> Target : HTTP 403
end

break Provisioning mode inactive
    API --> Target : HTTP 409
end

API -> API : **Validate UUID**\ncheck controller record file exists

break UUID unknown
    API --> Target : HTTP 404
    Target -> Target : **Continue unprovisioned**
end

API --> Target-- : HTTP 200\n""{ "token": "..." }""

Target -> Target : **Cleanup**\nDelete all controller records,\nclient records, and any stored backup

Target -> API++ : **GET /api/controllers**\n""provisioning-token: {token}""
API --> Target-- : HTTP 200\n""{ "controllers": ["uuid1", ...] }""

loop for each controller UUID
    Target -> API++ : **GET /api/controllers/{uuid}**\n""provisioning-token: {token}""
    API --> Target-- : HTTP 200\n""{controller record}""
    Target -> Target : **Encrypt and write to LittleFS**\n""/controllers/{uuid}""
end

Target -> API++ : **GET /api/clients**\n""provisioning-token: {token}""
API --> Target-- : HTTP 200\n""{ "clients": ["uuid1", ...] }""

loop for each client UUID
    Target -> API++ : **GET /api/clients/{uuid}**\n""provisioning-token: {token}""
    API --> Target-- : HTTP 200\n""{client record}""
    Target -> Target : **Encrypt and write to LittleFS**\n""/clients/{uuid}""
end

Target -> API++ : **GET /backup**\n""provisioning-token: {token}""
API --> Target-- : HTTP 200 or 404

Target -> Target : **Count verification**\ncompare files written vs UUID list counts

alt All counts match (backup OK or absent)
    Target -> Target : **Display result on OLED**\n5-second hold, then reboot into normal mode
else Count mismatch or backup failure
    Target -> Target : **Display failure on OLED**\nDo not reboot
end

User -> API++ : **Disable Provisioning Mode**\nDELETE /api/provisioning\n""{visual-token}""
API --> User : HTTP 202
API -> AP-- : **Shut down SoftAP**

@enduml
